@startuml
title GeoMiniLM Evaluation Gate Boundary

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

database "Training-Derived Data\nstarter + expansion" as Training
database "Grouped Development Families\nheld out by workflow family" as Families
component "Template Code\nhandwritten predicates + outputs" as Templates
component "TF-IDF Retriever\ncheckpoint + vocabulary" as Retriever
component "Versioned Candidate\nretriever + template code" as Candidate
database "Frozen Regression Set\ncurrent 14-record set" as Regression
database "Sealed Shadow Set\nfuture one-shot production set" as Shadow

component "Workflow-Only Evaluator\nno copied instruction/input credit" as Evaluator
component "Honest Baseline\ntraining-domain exemplar" as Baseline
component "Manifest Validation\nchecksums + immutable split metadata" as Manifest
component "Leakage Checks\nids + exact + near duplicate" as Leakage
component "Semantic / Executability Checks\nrequired before future acceptance" as Semantic
component "Per-Category Floors" as Categories
component "Prediction Confidence\nretrieval similarity calibration" as Confidence
component "Candidate Lock" as Lock

component "Integrity, quality,\ncategory, and confidence gates" as Gate
component "Dashboard Integration Eligible" as Eligible
component "Blocked\nnew development-only cycle" as Blocked

Training --> Families
Templates --> Candidate
Retriever --> Candidate
Families --> Retriever
Families --> Candidate : grouped development protocol
Candidate --> Lock
Lock --> Regression : regression benchmark
Lock --> Shadow : future sealed one-shot gate
Regression --> Evaluator
Shadow --> Evaluator
Candidate --> Evaluator
Baseline --> Evaluator
Manifest --> Gate
Leakage --> Gate
Semantic --> Gate
Evaluator --> Gate
Categories --> Gate
Confidence --> Gate

Gate --> Eligible : pass all checks
Gate --> Blocked : fail any check

note right of Gate
Authorization must be computed after
manifest, leakage, semantic/executability,
per-category, all-record, and confidence
checks are attached to the decision.
end note

note bottom of Regression
The reviewed 14-record set is now a
regression benchmark, not a clean source
for iterative model selection.
end note

@enduml
